# Datasets, derived embeddings, and other local data artifacts.
# Keep only dataset documentation so a clone explains how to obtain the data.
data/**
!data/**/
!data/**/README.md

# Downloaded model files. Keep their README and manifest files as acquisition notes.
models/**
!models/**/
!models/**/README.md
!models/**/MODEL_MANIFEST.md

# Reproducible caches and transient run artifacts.
**/embeddings/
**/*.npz
**/*.npy
**/*.pt
**/*.pth
**/*.ckpt
**/*.safetensors
**/*.bin
**/*.onnx
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
*.partial.*

# Local credentials.
.env*
